          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Nama fedhii Abbaa koo isa samii irraa raawwatu malee namni, 'Yaa Gooftaa, yaa Gooftaa' naan jedhu hundi mootummaa samiitti hin galu.",
